<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-GUYANA 22-2 IN SECOND INNINGS AT LUNCH V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GUYANA 22-2 IN SECOND INNINGS AT LUNCH V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guyana, set 319 to win by India, were 22 for two in their second innings at lunch on the final day of their four-day match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 341 and 277-4 declared (N.Sidhu 103, S.Ganguly 81); Guyana 300 and 22-2.</p>
</text>
